      <title>五部门新规今日施行 MCN机构全链条纳入监管</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai/post/20260901/%E4%BA%94%E9%83%A8%E9%97%A8%E6%96%B0%E8%A7%84%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E6%96%BD%E8%A1%8C-MCN%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E5%85%A8%E9%93%BE%E6%9D%A1%E7%BA%B3%E5%85%A5%E7%9B%91%E7%AE%A1/</link>
